\]


Fix any $x_0 \in M - \mathop{\mathrm{Sing}}(\F)$. 
From $\rho_{w,\F}(x_0) = w(d_g(x_0, \mathop{\mathrm{Sing}}(\F)))$ and $\delta(x) = d(x,\mathop{\mathrm{Sing}}(\F))/2$, we have the following equality: 
\[
