Notice that the compliment $\F - \mathcal S (\F)$ is a $C^q$ regular foliation, denoted by $\bm
{\F_{\mathrm{reg}}}$, of a surface $M - \mathop{\mathrm{Sing}}(\F)$, denoted by $\bm{M_{\mathrm{reg}}}$.  
