    \Ext^1_{H_m}\left(\mathbbm{1}_{m-n}\times|{\det}_n|^{k-\frac{m}{2}}, |{\det}_{m-k}|^{\frac{k-n}{2}}\times|{\det}_k|^{\frac{n-m+k}{2}}\right) 
