- \frac{{\rho T}}{{{S_9}}}\frac{{D + I + 2}}{{D + I}}\frac{{{\partial ^2}T}}{{\partial y\partial y}} + \frac{{3T}}{{{S_{10}}}}\frac{{\partial T}}{{\partial x}}\frac{{\partial \rho }}{{\partial x}} + \frac{{3\rho }}{{{S_{10}}}}\frac{{\partial T}}{{\partial x}}\frac{{\partial T}}{{\partial x}} + \frac{{3\rho T}}{{{S_{10}}}}\frac{{{\partial ^2}T}}{{\partial x\partial x}} + \frac{T}{{{S_{11}}}}\frac{{\partial T}}{{\partial y}}\frac{{\partial \rho }}{{\partial y}} \\
