This manuscript extends previous work by Evrard~et al.~\cite{Evrard2023} on calculating the geometric moments of the intersection between a polyhedron and the domain bounded by a quadratic surface. 
% Following the same methodology of successively applying the divergence theorem to derive closed-form expressions for the moments of the clipped polyhedron, we adapt and refine the method to derive similar expressions for the case of polyhedra intersecting the interior of an infinite cylinder. 
