\subsection{Contributions}
The contributions of this paper are:
\begin{itemize}
\item Add time to the formalization in \cite{ISOLA2022} of the primary notions of thread state and communication
  state within an AADL system.  
%  These notions provide the foundation
%  of conformity assessment by specifying what portions of a executing
%  system's state must be documented for traceability to definitions
