formal definition of services for AADL RTS \emph{including time} for upcoming major revisions to
the AADL standard.  
We simplified the semantics of \cite{ISOLA2022} to focus on timing behavior, and believe
the semantics described here can be applied to its more expansive, yet time-free semantics.


