	In the following, we show that the image of $ F $ is, in some sense, an affine hyperplane in $ l^1(\Z) $, namely
	\begin{equation*}\label{eq_U}
		U:=\left\{ (h_k)_{k\in\Z} \in \Z^\Z \ \middle| \ h_{2k} = 0 \text{ for all } k\in\Z \text{ and }\sum_{k\in\Z} |h_k|<\infty \text{ and } \sum_{k\in\Z} h_k = 1 \right\}.
