\centering
\vspace{-0.3cm}
\includegraphics[width=\linewidth]{figure/rd_agent_costeer.pdf}
\vspace{-0.45cm}
\caption{Diagram of the \texttt{Co-STEER} workflow. In the context of factor development, it consists of two main modules: the scheduling module ingests candidate tasks and performs iterative ranking based on multiple factors; the implementation module learns from previous code execution results to construct a fine-grained, transferable knowledge base applicable across tasks.}
