\begin{remark}
    The families in degrees congruent to $23, 47, 71, 95, 119, 143$, and $167$ also lie in the Hurewicz image of the fibre of $\psi^3-1\colon \TMF\to \TMF$. The key fact is that $\psi^3-1$ acts on $\pi_{\ast,\ast}\TMF_\BP$ injectively in AN-filtration $0$ and zero elsewhere. In fact, this holds for the fibre of $\psi^N-1$ for any odd integer $N$. We leave the details to the reader.
\end{remark}

